    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Paul, where did you go to have fun today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：我今天去了洗手间，那里特别好玩。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我今天去了洗手間，那裡特別好玩。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ jīn tiān qù le xǐ shǒu jiān nà lǐ tè bié hǎo wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Today I went to the toilet. It’s great fun there."
    },
    {
